# Intermediate images on the way from resource/ to assets/.
build/

# Build output.
iron_demo
iron_demo.exe
*.o

# Note for anyone reading this in the history: assets/merchant_idle.h and
# assets/portraits_merchant.h used to be ignored here, dating from when they
# were magenta placeholders that must never reach a submission. They stopped
# being placeholders in 1.2 and the ignore stayed, so every fresh clone failed
# on a missing include before it could run a single test - while the other
# five generated headers in assets/ were committed all along.
#
# All seven are committed now. They are generated, and `make assets` still
# reproduces them byte for byte from resource/, but a repo that cannot be
# built by the command its own README names is worse than a repo carrying
# 13 KB of derived data.
